  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39760376",
      "title": "Getting Started with a User Input Component",
      "sourceHash": "0ff04619e1d230507c21130320790ff61bb24c9ae37b18204088d0b7eb754ae7",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.75,
          "end": 4.56,
          "en": "So now that we added this header component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.56,
          "end": 7.17,
          "en": "I'd say the next step that makes sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.17,
          "end": 10.53,
          "en": "to build this investment calculator app here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.53,
          "end": 15.06,
          "en": "is to add a component that handles the user input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.06,
          "end": 18.42,
          "en": "because we'll need this input to calculate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.42,
          "end": 20.25,
          "en": "the investment result data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.25,
          "end": 22.53,
          "en": "So the data we need for this table,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.53,
          "end": 24.84,
          "en": "which you wanna show on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.84,
          "end": 28.02,
          "en": "And therefore, I'll add another new component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.02,
          "end": 30.36,
          "en": "because of course, as you already learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.36,
          "end": 33.66,
          "en": "in the previous sections, the goal with React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.66,
          "end": 37.05,
          "en": "is to split your app into such components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.05,
          "end": 41.07,
          "en": "where every component has its own responsibility.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.07,
          "end": 43.35,
          "en": "And I'd say getting that user input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.35,
          "end": 45.84,
          "en": "is a separate feature of the app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.84,
          "end": 48.3,
          "en": "that should go into a separate component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.3,
          "end": 52.02,
          "en": "and that's why I will add a separate component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.02,
          "end": 54.843,
          "en": "The user input component, we could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.95,
          "end": 59.325,
          "en": "And this is a component that will be responsible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.325,
          "end": 63.72,
          "en": "for fetching the different pieces of user input we need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.72,
          "end": 66.75,
          "en": "The initial investment amount and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.75,
          "end": 69.6,
          "en": "And therefore in here we'll export a never",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.6,
          "end": 74.16,
          "en": "component function and in this component function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.16,
          "end": 78.27,
          "en": "I want to return a section, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.27,
          "end": 82.38,
          "en": "or we could also return a form but we'll explore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.38,
          "end": 86.78999999999999,
          "en": "working with form elements and dive a bit deeper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.78999999999999,
          "end": 91.2,
          "en": "into handling user input with React later in the course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 91.2,
          "end": 93.24000000000001,
          "en": "in a separate section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 93.24000000000001,
          "end": 96.31,
          "en": "Therefore, for now, I'll just go for a section here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 97.53,
          "end": 101.97,
          "en": "and I'll give this section an idea of user input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 101.97,
          "end": 103.62,
          "en": "because that's another ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.62,
          "end": 106.22999999999999,
          "en": "you can find in the index CSS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.22999999999999,
          "end": 108.87,
          "en": "In there you'll find CSS rules",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.87,
          "end": 113.28999999999999,
          "en": "that are looking for an element with an ID user input on it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 114.33,
          "end": 117.25,
          "en": "and that's why I'm adding this here to this section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 118.41,
          "end": 121.11,
          "en": "and then in here, in this section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 121.11,
          "end": 125.4,
          "en": "I wanna output various input fields.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 125.4,
          "end": 127.92,
          "en": "And to structure those input fields",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.92,
          "end": 131.85,
          "en": "and to make them look good, I'll add a div here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 131.85,
          "end": 136.23,
          "en": "with a CSS class added with the class name prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 136.23,
          "end": 140.223,
          "en": "as you learned, input group on it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 141.63,
          "end": 145.89,
          "en": "which is also something you'll find in the index CSS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 145.89,
          "end": 147.72,
          "en": "There you'll find this rule",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 147.72,
          "end": 151.68,
          "en": "looking for such a input group CSS class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 151.68,
          "end": 153.96,
          "en": "And I'm adding it here on this div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 153.96,
          "end": 157.38,
          "en": "so that inside of that div we can add a paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 157.38,
          "end": 159.34,
          "en": "which will then hold a label",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 161.57999999999998,
          "end": 164.94,
          "en": "and an input element inside of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 164.94,
          "end": 168.12,
          "en": "And my idea is simply to have multiple such",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 168.12,
          "end": 171.72,
          "en": "label input combinations inside of a input group",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 171.72,
          "end": 175.382,
          "en": "and this input group CSS class will simply make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 175.382,
          "end": 178.5,
          "en": "that these different paragraphs are showing up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 178.5,
          "end": 180.603,
          "en": "next to each other in the same row.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 181.98,
          "end": 185.76,
          "en": "But now here, the idea for those input elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 185.76,
          "end": 190.623,
          "en": "is to ask the user for the initial investment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 191.46,
          "end": 194.02,
          "en": "So the amount that's initially invested",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 195.21,
          "end": 199.67000000000002,
          "en": "and to ask the user for the annual investment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 201.27,
          "end": 204.87,
          "en": "So how much money the user wants to invest every year",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 204.87,
          "end": 206.673,
          "en": "after the initial investment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 207.78,
          "end": 210.96,
          "en": "And then I want to have a second input group",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 210.96,
          "end": 214.35,
          "en": "below the first group, where we also ask",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 214.35,
          "end": 217.71,
          "en": "for the expected return.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 217.71,
          "end": 220.05,
          "en": "So that expected rate of return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 220.05,
          "end": 223.053,
          "en": "which the user expects to earn every year.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 224.31,
          "end": 228.36,
          "en": "And then last but not least, the duration of the investment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 228.36,
          "end": 232.5,
          "en": "So how long the user plans to hold that investment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 232.5,
          "end": 234.09300000000002,
          "en": "until the money is needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 235.26,
          "end": 238.65,
          "en": "These are the four input fields I want to have here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 238.65,
          "end": 241.56,
          "en": "The four label input combinations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 241.56,
          "end": 244.26,
          "en": "and for every label we have a input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 244.26,
          "end": 248.01,
          "en": "where we expect to get a number as an input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 248.01,
          "end": 251.22,
          "en": "So I'll set the input type here to number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 251.22,
          "end": 255.48,
          "en": "which simply influences how the input field is displayed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 255.48,
          "end": 257.553,
          "en": "to the user and how it works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 259.2,
          "end": 262.23,
          "en": "And I'll therefore do that for all these input fields",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 262.23,
          "end": 266.343,
          "en": "because all these values are numbers in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 269.22,
          "end": 272.82,
          "en": "And in addition, I'll also add the required",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 272.82,
          "end": 275.55,
          "en": "prop to all these input fields,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 275.55,
          "end": 279.51,
          "en": "which will simply make sure that a value must be entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 279.51,
          "end": 282.75,
          "en": "and we could also write required equals true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 282.75,
          "end": 285.63,
          "en": "but just adding the prop like this is a bit shorter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 285.63,
          "end": 287.58299999999997,
          "en": "and will achieve the same result.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 289.35,
          "end": 293.093,
          "en": "And now we of course need to add some logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 293.093,
          "end": 296.82,
          "en": "to get hold of that value that's entered by the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 296.82,
          "end": 301.14,
          "en": "and to reflect that value back into that input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 301.14,
          "end": 303.39,
          "en": "So we need that two-way binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 303.39,
          "end": 305.643,
          "en": "I showed you earlier in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}